            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nI too use Firefox and everything works fine. There are *very rare* instances of the same issue, but refreshing the page loads the video fine.\r\n\r\nWhat operating system and Firefox version do you use? Also, did you try going through [list of steps suggested by Firefox](https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/fix-common-audio-and-video-issues)?\r\n\r\n------\r\n\r\nAll demo videos are recorded as mp4 video files with H.264 codec. This codec is [recommended by GitHub itself](https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/writing-on-github/working-with-advanced-formatting/attaching-files).",
            "created_at": "2024-10-18T08:28:24Z",
